      "role": "user",
      "content": "uhm okay but i dont really want to go to the er right now it's super expensive and i've had stomach aches before when i'm just bloated. it's not like a constant stabbing, it just comes in waves. can i just try taking some extra strength Tylenol or maybe some Pepto for now and see if it settles down by morning? it feels like it might just be gas or something.",
